				<td>
                                    <span id="ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_lblTitle2"><font face="Tahoma" color="Black" size="2">A resolution urging the Office of Homeless Services to allocate funding to ensure that no Nashvillians lose their permanent housing due to the changes in the federal Continuum of Care funding priorities.</font></span>
